The ordnance crew has no more demanding and dangerous duty

22
00:01:39,781 --> 00:01:43,340
than transporting the world's most advanced bombs to the flight deck.

23
00:01:43,341 --> 00:01:50,500
They're going to pull the weapons off the elevator car and they're going to perform

24
